@startuml
title VisionRealtimePipeline 内部时序（统一对比粒度）

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 12

participant "RealtimeAgentRealtimePipeline Caller\nRealtimeAgentApp" as Caller

box "VisionRealtimePipeline / Vision 实现" #FFF4E5
participant "VisionRealtimePipeline\n[差异] Pipeline实现" as Pipeline
participant "RealtimeAudioNormalizer\n[共享] 格式适配/重采样" as Normalizer
participant "VisionRealtimeAgentCore\n[差异] 对话语义/上下文/打断" as Core
participant "VisionInputBoundary\n[差异] Paraformer事件解释" as Boundary
participant "VisionResponseEngine\n[差异] 文本模型 + TTS" as Response
participant "RealtimeOutputController\n[共享] 下行水位/输出状态" as Output
participant "PipelineEventEmitter\n[共享] 统一事件输出" as Emitter
end box

box "Vision Providers / Vision 专属外部能力" #E8F2FF
participant "Paraformer Realtime V2\nASR provider" as AsrProvider
participant "Vision Model Provider\n文本模型" as VisionModel
participant "Streaming TTS Provider\n语音合成" as TtsProvider
end box

== 1. 会话初始化 ==

Caller -> Pipeline: open_session(user_id, session_id)
Pipeline -> Core: open_session(user_id, session_id)
Core -> Core: compile context\ninitialize message buffers\nstate=listening
Core -> Boundary: prepare_session(config.asr)
Core -> Response: prepare_session(context)
Pipeline -> Emitter: emit(session_ready)
Emitter --> Caller: PipelineEvent.session_ready

== 2. 上下行连接绑定 ==

Caller -> Pipeline: attach_upstream(stream_ref)
Pipeline -> Core: attach_upstream(stream_ref)
Core -> Boundary: attach_upstream(stream_ref)
Boundary -> AsrProvider: connect and start task\nmax_sentence_silence=config
AsrProvider --> Boundary: task started
Boundary --> Core: upstream_ready
Core --> Pipeline: upstream_ready
Pipeline -> Emitter: emit(upstream_ready)
Emitter --> Caller: PipelineEvent.upstream_ready

Caller -> Pipeline: attach_downstream(stream_ref)
Pipeline -> Core: attach_downstream(stream_ref)
Core -> Response: attach_downstream(stream_ref)
Response -> TtsProvider: prepare streaming session
TtsProvider --> Response: tts ready
Core -> Output: bind downstream stream_ref
Output --> Core: downstream_ready
Core --> Pipeline: downstream_ready
Pipeline -> Emitter: emit(downstream_ready)
Emitter --> Caller: PipelineEvent.downstream_ready

== 3. 上行音频处理 ==

loop audio_session 未关闭
  Caller -> Pipeline: append_input_audio(chunk)
  Pipeline -> Normalizer: process(chunk)
  Normalizer --> Pipeline: normalized chunk
  Pipeline -> Core: append_input_audio(normalized chunk)
  Core -> Boundary: append_audio(normalized chunk)
  Boundary -> AsrProvider: audio frame
end

== 4. 输入边界：用户开始说话 ==

AsrProvider --> Boundary: sentence_begin
Boundary --> Core: InputBoundaryEvent.speech_started
Core -> Core: user_speaking=true
Core --> Pipeline: PipelineEvent.speech_started
Pipeline -> Emitter: emit(speech_started)
Emitter --> Caller: PipelineEvent.speech_started

alt assistant output is active
  Core -> Core: append assistant partial message\ncontent=generated_text + "<用户打断>"
  Core -> Core: mark current generation interrupted
  Core -> Response: cancel_current_response(generation_id)
  Core -> Output: cancel_active_output()
  Output --> Core: output_cancel_requested
  Core --> Pipeline: PipelineEvent.output_cancel_requested
  Pipeline -> Emitter: emit(output_cancel_requested)
  Emitter --> Caller: PipelineEvent.output_cancel_requested
else no active output
  Core -> Core: keep listening
end

note over Core,Response
旧 generation 的 LLM/TTS 回调必须按 generation_id 丢弃。
丢弃旧回调不能写 response.failed，也不能触发错误兜底音频。
end note

== 5. 输入边界：用户停止说话并形成用户消息 ==

AsrProvider --> Boundary: partial transcript
Boundary --> Core: InputBoundaryEvent.transcript_delta(text)
Core -> Core: update transcript buffer

AsrProvider --> Boundary: sentence_end + final transcript
Boundary --> Core: InputBoundaryEvent.speech_stopped(text)
Core -> Core: user_speaking=false\nappend user message(text)\nstate=thinking
Core --> Pipeline: PipelineEvent.speech_stopped
Pipeline -> Emitter: emit(speech_stopped)
Emitter --> Caller: PipelineEvent.speech_stopped

== 6. 回复生成：Vision 模式差异点 ==

Core -> Response: start_response(context + user message)
Response -> VisionModel: stream request

loop text delta -> TTS audio chunk
  VisionModel --> Response: text delta
  Response --> Core: ResponseEvent.text_delta(text)
  Core -> Core: append assistant text buffer
  Core -> Response: synthesize_text_delta(text)
  Response -> TtsProvider: push text delta
  TtsProvider --> Response: audio chunk
  Response --> Core: ResponseEvent.audio_delta(bytes, format)
  Core -> Output: enqueue_output_audio(bytes, format)
  Output --> Core: output_audio_delta
  Core --> Pipeline: PipelineEvent.output_audio_delta
  Pipeline -> Emitter: emit(output_audio_delta)
  Emitter --> Caller: PipelineEvent.output_audio_delta(bytes, format)
end

VisionModel --> Response: done
Response -> TtsProvider: flush()
TtsProvider --> Response: remaining audio / done
Response --> Core: ResponseEvent.output_finished
Core -> Core: append assistant message(full content)\nstate=listening
Core -> Output: finish_output()
Output --> Core: output_finished
Core --> Pipeline: PipelineEvent.output_finished
Pipeline -> Emitter: emit(output_finished)
Emitter --> Caller: PipelineEvent.output_finished

== 7. 共享下行水位控制 ==

Caller -> Pipeline: pause_downstream()
Pipeline -> Output: pause()
Output -> Core: downstream_paused=true

Caller -> Pipeline: resume_downstream()
Pipeline -> Output: resume()
Output --> Core: buffered output_audio_delta
Core --> Pipeline: PipelineEvent.output_audio_delta
Pipeline -> Emitter: emit(output_audio_delta)
Emitter --> Caller: PipelineEvent.output_audio_delta(bytes, format)

== 8. 关闭连续对话 ==

alt idle timeout
  Core -> Core: idle timer reached
  Core --> Pipeline: PipelineEvent.close_requested(reason=idle_timeout)
else vision model requests close
  VisionModel --> Response: tool_call(close_audio_session)
  Response --> Core: ResponseEvent.close_tool_call(tool_call_id)
  Core -> Core: append assistant tool_call message
  Core -> Core: append tool result message
  Core --> Pipeline: PipelineEvent.close_requested
end
Pipeline -> Emitter: emit(close_requested)
Emitter --> Caller: PipelineEvent.close_requested

Caller -> Pipeline: detach_upstream(reason)
Pipeline -> Core: detach_upstream(reason)
Core -> Boundary: close()
Boundary -> AsrProvider: finish task / close

Caller -> Pipeline: prepare_close(reason)
Pipeline -> Core: prepare_close(reason)
Core -> Output: stop_accepting_new_output()
Core -> Response: finish_or_cancel()
Response -> TtsProvider: drain or cancel
Core -> Output: finish_or_cancel()
Output --> Core: output_finished or output_cancel_requested
Core --> Pipeline: PipelineEvent.output_finished\nor PipelineEvent.output_cancel_requested
Pipeline -> Emitter: emit(output_finished/output_cancel_requested)
Emitter --> Caller: PipelineEvent.output_finished\nor PipelineEvent.output_cancel_requested

Caller -> Pipeline: close_session(reason)
Pipeline -> Core: close_session(reason)
Core -> Response: close()
Response -> TtsProvider: close
Core -> Core: clear state
Core --> Pipeline: PipelineEvent.session_closed
Pipeline -> Emitter: emit(session_closed)
Emitter --> Caller: PipelineEvent.session_closed

@enduml
